# Vercel only builds the frontend; keep the backend and any secrets out of CLI uploads.
/*
!WhatsAPP_crm-main
WhatsAPP_crm-main/*
!WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend
WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend/node_modules
WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend/dist
WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend/.vercel
WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend/.env*
!WhatsAPP_crm-main/frontend/.env.example
